  "rules": [
    "Power Class is presentation only; it defines no stats, damage, drop rate, acquisition or authority.",
    "The six original Standard-S summons are Power Class A by owner direction: their concept appearance reads A, not S. Their summon rarity stays Standard S.",
    "Six new S off-rate summons fill the S tier, one per element: Vulcaryn, Nerivelle, Fulgarys, Umbryss, Jadewarden, Solenne.",
    "Each S off-rate pet has unique regalia and no shared accessory motif; the first pass's repeated three-ring regalia was rejected and regenerated.",
    "Icarus is S Limited and shown as a reference card using existing approved art, not a new generation.",
    "The 30 map regular Pets keep catalog ranks 12 A / 18 B; shared race bases are labelled B as bodies.",
    "Class badges never replace or recolour element identity."
  ],
